  <div class="feature-copy-list">
    <article>
      <h3>The status, plainly</h3><p>
        No independent external security audit has been completed. Internal and
        AI-assisted security reviews are maintainer evidence. The next step is
        preparing a scope and funding proposal, without promising an audit date.
      </p>
    </article><article>
      <h3>Known work belongs in the scope</h3><p>
        Sync v1 encrypts data, but possession of its account locator authorizes
        ciphertext retrieval, replacement and deletion. Concurrent writes and
        deletion can race. Merged request-size limits are not yet deployed.
        These unresolved findings remain part of the <a
          href="https://github.com/bnfy/blanc/blob/main/docs/security-assessment.md"
          >public maintainer assessment</a
        >.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
